          "lore_md": "The founder never died. That is the first heresy every outsider believes and the first lesson every childe unlearns: Set was destroyed in the war with Horus, and what walks the Land of the Black Sand is something else wearing his absence. Cult doctrine says the God-Killer tore himself free of death the way he tore himself free of law, and waits in the western desert for the final age when all gods die together. Expeditions that went looking found sandstorm, silence, and one survivor each — all of whom described the same conversation: a voice asking, with genuine curiosity, what they were willing to become. The Ministry's inner temples treat his word as weather. SchreckNET treats his word as a pending event.",
