          "lore_md": "The monster the Russians did not invent but certainly kept. Baba Yaga ruled the deep cold for a millennium, and when she woke in 1999 the entire Nosferatu infrastructure of Siberia went silent in a week. The clan reports her destroyed — the twins, Nosferatu childer of terrible reputation, are credited with it — but the file notes the Metro-2 doors still open for someone. Registry status: PROBABLY DESTROYED 1999. The word \"probably\" is doing more work than any analyst is comfortable with.",
