          "lore_md": "Former MGM makeup artist, current landlord of every secret in the film industry. Gary knows which studio head is on whose ledger, which starlet is a ghoul, and which premier was replaced in 1987 by something with better cheekbones. He trades in introductions, not blackmail — a policy that has outlived six princes. His network of former stunt doubles and gaffers is the reason nothing happens on a Los Angeles backlot without the rats knowing first.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_nosferatu03.png"
