          "threat": "mid",
          "lore_md": "Embraced out of a Toreador life she refuses to discuss, Imalia kept the eye and lost the face. She runs paparazzi logic on the Kindred world: long lenses, patient waits, and the exact moment to publish. Her feud with Gary Golden is legendary and possibly staged — the archives note that every \"feud\" between them has coincidentally produced information the whole clan needed. She files her scoops with the network before she sells them. The rats call this professional courtesy; the princes call it blackmail with a receipt.",
