      "weakness": "A Daughter's emotions bleed into her voice as involuntary melody — she cannot speak without singing, and strong feeling cracks her speech into song that carries unnaturally far.",
      "lore_md": "Nobody agrees who Embraced the first Daughter. The registry lists candidates in three clans and all of them are dead or lying. What is certain: the bloodline walks the line between Brujah fire and Malkavian static, and its signature Discipline, Melpominee, lets the voice do things throats should not do — project into a listener's skull, carry across water, make the dead relive a funeral hymn.\n\nThe Sabbat adopted the line early because a song that shatters courage is a weapon, and the Second Inquisition adopted the fear of it later, because a song that shatters courage is a message. Acoustic teams now sweep every known warren for harmonic signatures.\n\nSchreckNET flags: audio anomalies that repeat at the same hour in city drainage systems, 4-7 Hz sub-bass under pop frequencies, and choir recordings that gain a singer after archiving. Rule of thumb on the net: if a recording gets louder on its own, do not archive it again — report it.",
