          "lore_md": "A mason’s golem who organized. Halloran spent a century as a tenement watchdog, then a century more as the gargoyles’ negotiator — the one who explains to princes that the nest has dues, terms, and a walk-out clause. Fictional-registry entry (plausible canon-adjacent). His ledger of \"wages owed by Tremere, unpaid since 1480\" is said to run to eleven pages. He files copies with SchreckNET voluntarily, on the theory that an audit in the open protects his people better than a warren. Union rules: no gargoyle works a siege unasked.",
