      "weakness": "Death-pale, corpse-still features that no mask of vitae fully repairs.",
      "lore_md": "The Harbingers of Skulls are what the Cappadocians became after their own clan tried to murder its founder and stolen legacy buried them. When Augustus Giovanni diablerized Cappadocius in 1444, the majority of the older clan was walled into a cavern under Erciyes or scattered into the world of the dead. They did not die. They waited.\n\nThey surfaced in 1999, in the same year the Week of Nightmares tore the Shroud thin, and declared a single purpose: the extinction of Clan Giovanni. Every ledger, every consul, every palazzo safe-room is a target. The Camarilla calls them Skull Pigeons and files them under rumor; the Hecata file them under open war.\n\nSchreckNET encounters are rare and unwelcome. Their bone-script answers questionnaires nobody sent. Flag OSSUARY-PING: any network terminal left in an ossuary or catacomb for more than one night returns a login older than the terminal itself. Registry attribution for every entry below is disputed; the Harbingers edit their own records.",
