          "lore_md": "Runs the most reliable wakes in the Gulf — kindred funerals with the body actually attended to, which in modern nights makes her almost unique. Sister Nine-Nights charges no fee and keeps no list; the Hecata families of Louisiana tolerate her because their own dead prefer her rites to theirs. Filed cooperative. Standing note: she has predicted the Final Death of seven kindred on the network, each prediction correct within a week, each delivered as a simple white envelope at a wake.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_lamia04.png"
