          "lore_md": "The oldest confirmed Salubri still on the board, asleep somewhere along the Yangtze since before the Han, tended by a chain of mortal families who have kept the appointment for two thousand years. Zao-Lat heals through dreams when he can be bothered to dream at all. Three dynasties have tried to wake him for war; all three are footnotes. The file exists mostly as coordinates that are wrong on purpose, and one instruction: do not accept any invitation to a healing that arrives before you are sick.",
