          "lore_md": "There is a file with no name, no city, and eleven corroborated sightings. In each, a kindred being healed by a Salubri reports — independently, in different languages, centuries apart — that the healer's third eye was not looking at them. It was looking past them, at whatever was standing behind. The file notes that every archive photograph processed through node maintainers acquires a third watermark dot that no one added. The protocol is one line long: if the dot opens, close the node. Analysts are not required to believe the file. They are required to keep it.",
