          "lore_md": "Ferreau has kept a clinic in Port-au-Prince since before the country existed, through every government, occupation and earthquake, treating the sick in the front rooms and arranging permanent cures in the back. His cabinet of instruments is older than several navies. He trained half the bloodline's working killers and all of its surgeons, and his ledger of debts — kept in a hand nobody else can read — is the closest thing the Samedi have to law. The SI raided once, in 2019, and reported finding only a clean, empty clinic that smelled of lilies.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_sam02.png"
